          deckDescription: 'A 54-card Industrie und Glück tarock deck with 21 numbered trumps plus the Skus and 32 suit cards. Black suits keep King, Queen, Cavalier, Jack, 10, 9, 8, 7; red suits keep King, Queen, Cavalier, Jack, Ace, 2, 3, 4.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits are divided into black suits (Spades and Clubs) and red suits (Hearts and Diamonds), each with its own reduced pip sequence.',
